#: src/postulo/plugins/identifiers/schemes.py:134
#, draft
msgid ""
"That ORCID's last digit does not match the rest, so one of them is a typo."
msgstr ""
"L-aħħar ċifra ta’ dan l-ORCID ma taqbilx mal-bqija, allura waħda minnhom hija żball."

#: src/postulo/plugins/identifiers/schemes.py:203
#, draft
msgid "The LEI's check digits do not match."
msgstr "Iċ-ċifri ta' kontroll tal-LEI ma jaqblux."

#: src/postulo/plugins/identifiers/__init__.py:55
#, draft
msgid ""
"Which external identifiers Postulo understands — ORCID, ISNI, Wikidata, a legal-entity identifier, a company register number — what each one should look like, where it links, and whether it identifies a person, an organisation or both. Nothing here is ever looked up online."
msgstr ""
"Liema identifikaturi esterni jifhem Postulo — ORCID, ISNI, Wikidata, identifikatur ta’ entità legali, numru ta’ reġistru ta’ kumpanija —, kif għandu jidher kull wieħed, fejn iwassal, u jekk jidentifikax persuna, organizzazzjoni jew it-tnejn. Xejn minn dan qatt ma jiġi mfittex online."
